{{also|byt|byť|by't}}
==Czech==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|cs|zlw-ocs|býti}}, from {{inh|cs|sla-pro|*byti}}, from {{der|cs|ine-pro|*bʰuH-||to become}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{cs-IPA}}
* {{audio|cs|Cs-být.ogg|audio}}
* {{hyphenation|cs|být}}
* {{rhymes|cs|iːt}}
* {{homophones|cs|bít}}

===Verb===
{{cs-verb|a=i}}

# to [[be]]
#: {{uxi|cs|Ten kabát '''je''' vlhký|The coat is wet.}}
# to [[be]] {{gloss|to exist}}
# {{lb|cs|auxiliary}} {{non-gloss definition|Used to form [[past tense]] forms of verbs with [[past participle]]s.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Jel '''jsem''' do Prahy.|I went to Prague.}}
# {{lb|cs|auxiliary}} {{non-gloss definition|Used to form [[future tense]] forms of verbs with [[infinitive]]s.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Budu''' ti pomáhat.|I will be helping you.}}
# {{lb|cs|auxiliary}} {{non-gloss definition|Used to form [[conditional mood]] forms of verbs with [[past participle]]s.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|Já '''bych''' to neudělal.|I would not do it.}}
# {{lb|cs|auxiliary}} {{non-gloss definition|Used to form [[passive voice]] forms of verbs with [[passive participles]].}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Jsem''' překvapen.|I am surprised.}}
# {{lb|cs|auxiliary}} {{non-gloss definition|Used to form [[conditional]] forms of verbs with [[past participles|past]] and [[passive participle]]s.}}
#: {{uxi|cs|'''Byl''' by tam šel, kdyby ho '''byli''' pozvali.|He would have gone there if they had invited him.}}

